  "description": "FSJobScheduler is a lightweight and high-performance task scheduler for .NET applications.\nIt allows you to register multiple recurring jobs with flexible intervals.\nSupports fully async actions, background execution, and safe concurrent job handling.\nPerfect for console apps, services, bots, background workers, and automation tasks.\nSimple API, no dependencies — add jobs and start scheduling in seconds.",
